   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ubudehe Databas</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ubudehe Database</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen bidrar till Ubudehe databasens f&#xe4;rdigst&#xe4;llande. Data p&#xe5; social stratifiering &#xe4;r insamlad fr&#xe5;n alla Rwandas hush&#xe5;ll. Det &#xe5;terst&#xe5;r att f&#xf6;ra &#xf6;ver datan fr&#xe5;n pappersformul&#xe4;r till en elektronisk database och g&#xf6;ra denna tillg&#xe4;nglig f&#xf6;r avseda anv&#xe4;ndare inkluderande Ministry of Local Government och Ministry of Health.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution is for the completion of the Ubudehe Database. Data on social stratification has been collected from all Rwanda  households. It remains to enter the data into an electronic database and make it accessible to intended users, including Ministry of Local Government and Ministry of Health.</narrative>
  </description>
